%% Scraping pipeline (decoupled subsystem)
flowchart LR
    ORCH[Scraping Orchestrator] --> REG[Source Registry]
    REG --> AD[Source Adapter]
    AD --> F[Fetcher: HTTP / Browser]
    F --> P[Parser versioned]
    P --> N[Normalizer]
    N --> VAL[Validation / quality]
    VAL --> EV[Product Event]
    EV --> ST[(Product Store / Search Index)]
    F -. timeout/error .-> CB{Circuit breaker}
    CB -- open --> SKIP[Skip source, continue others]
